{"overview":"Reporter Charles Wills, in Paris to cover the end of World War II, falls for the beautiful Helen Ellswirth following a brief flirtation with her sister, Marion. After he and Helen marry, Charles pursues his novelistic ambition while supporting his new bride with a deadening job at a newspaper wire service. But when an old investment suddenly makes the family wealthy, their marriage begins to unravel — until a sudden tragedy changes everything.","tagline":"The sensational story of youth on a fling","cast":[{"n":"Elizabeth Taylor","c":"Helen Ellswirth","p":"/eMUUN7yGSSH4G4dcqnKAZTquZP.jpg","q":"Q34851"},{"n":"Van Johnson","c":"Charles Wills","p":"/A6vw5kbdmyXDz1ddQOocJmg9TSc.jpg","q":"Q436638"},{"n":"Walter Pidgeon","c":"James Ellswirth","p":"/bzSDciaTy9vshH4Rguyu5elcSR7.jpg","q":"Q350640"},{"n":"Donna Reed","c":"Marion Ellswirth","p":"/gO2sb3qfGWn9beecguFErp0tlv9.jpg","q":"Q224021"},{"n":"Eva Gabor","c":"Lorraine Quarl","p":"/gApDSJixCnXin3LYmAbMx7Ly4VV.jpg","q":"Q235928"},{"n":"Kurt Kasznar","c":"Maurice","p":"/ewpi0jZ6aPM5aQ0mIISXLQGZ04u.jpg","q":"Q113997"},{"n":"George Dolenz","c":"Claude Matine","p":"/9kWuPK1A3vVEs474xPmQWmazmk5.jpg","q":"Q3101539"},{"n":"Roger Moore","c":"Paul","p":"/anMuX2HBIMvLUZm7A6yuKSqiJxP.jpg","q":"Q134333"},{"n":"Sandy Descher","c":"Vicki","p":"/9TCszGJRKvx1OSMz05xv5oDw3H5.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Celia Lovsky","c":"Mama","p":"/kyxxWyoKXmlNxptefqnjCtY6Sz0.jpg","q":"Q85232"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Last_Time_I_Saw_Paris","qid":"Q1158191","rel":{"DE":{"d":"1955-09-02","c":"12"},"JP":{"d":"1955-04-03","c":"R18+"},"MX":{"d":"1954-11-18","c":"B-15"},"SE":{"d":"1955-08-08","c":"15"},"US":{"d":"1954-11-18","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/wXWDKXTOzWGOwWJC5sVl0KHTGcp.jpg","/rQtyakGUsam9itbzPEmNZDzBx5L.jpg","/t67Ca9BWX1y8M3LYkZB5BXIWvFT.jpg","/5UkQJVLB8x2iWeHvqE3dWGKlbP5.jpg","/uQzyOha9AgLJSrTbiawDLEgLwnk.jpg","/4wYxEaGCfsHuxbMSb2Nay1rnlE6.jpg","/36YwBjaQSKnU5LAnzrBw7RgWsgv.jp